The driver provides support for the MPL115A2 pressure sensor.  It
allows  reporting  absolute pressure through the API.  The device
first appeared in The driver was written by The fixed‐point pres‐
sure calculation algorithm was suggested by The MPL115A2 chip has
an accuracy of +/‐ 1 kPa, which makes  it  not  very  useful  for
weather‐related  applications.  The API does not support pressure
reporting yet, so the result is reported just as integer number.
